   "source": [
    "A function is a block of code that performs a specific task. Functions help in organizing code, reusing code, and\n",
    "improving readability."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "id": "e3a39d59",
   "metadata": {},
